<title>ISRAEL: Arafat opens Gaza meeting on Mideast peace.</title>
<headline>Arafat opens Gaza meeting on Mideast peace.</headline>
<dateline>GAZA 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat opened an international meeting on Saturday aimed at defusing a crisis in Middle East peacemaking over Israeli settlement plans in Arab East Jerusalem.</p>
<p>Ignoring Israeli objections, representatives of the United States, the European Union, Japan and Arab countries attended the conference in Palestinian-ruled Gaza City.</p>
